== Differential Galois theory

#statement("Definition")[
Differential field extension $E\/F$ is a #emph[Picard-Vessiot extension]#index-entry("Picard-Vessiot extension") if

+ $E\,F$ have the same ring of constants

+ $E$ is by adjoining in solutions to a linear homogeneous differential equation

]
